' Two humans, no machine players. Anna hires in New Sandez, camps her man at
' Bearwoods and waits **inside** Bearwoods until she starves: LocationScene
' puts her out before World.Turn looks, so her camp and her man stay hers.
' Her leader comes back ten days later, unseen; she stays out. Bob lives on
' Sana's well.
' Run with `menu seed 7 start 0 start2 1 savefile <f>`.
menuclick 160,100        ' the intro: a click goes to the start screen (IntroScene.cs:135-139)
menuclick 161,165        ' MODE: Original
menuclick 206,165        ' AI: none (DisableAI)
menuclick 60,104
type Anna
menuclick 250,104
type Bob
menuclick 163,54         ' START
wait 3
' Day 1. Anna hires in New Sandez and sets out for Bearwoods.
mapclick 75,303
clickon 248
hire
wait 20
esc                      ' out to the map
mapclick 61,355          ' sets out: two days
' Bob goes into Sana and drinks at the well.
mapclick 150,318
wait 10
mapclick 303,115
wait 5
esc
day
' Day 2: Anna on the road; Bob drinks.
mapclick 303,115
wait 5
esc
day
' Anna arrives: into Bearwoods, water for both, the man stays, back to the map.
mapclick 61,355
wait 120
mapclick 500,233
wait 20
esc
wait 30
join
day
mapclick 303,115
wait 5
esc
day
day
mapclick 303,115
wait 5
esc
day
day
mapclick 303,115
wait 5
esc
day
day
mapclick 303,115
wait 5
esc
day
day
mapclick 303,115
wait 5
esc
day
day
mapclick 303,115
wait 5
esc
day
day
mapclick 303,115
wait 5
esc
day
day
mapclick 303,115
wait 5
esc
day
day
mapclick 303,115
wait 5
esc
day
day
mapclick 303,115
wait 5
esc
day
day
mapclick 303,115
wait 5
esc
day
esc                      ' Anna's DeathScene: a key goes back to WaitScene
save                     ' the cut: Bob's turn, Anna out, her camp still hers
